* Netlist provenance snapshot -- sim/README.md convention
* Frozen from design/sg13cmos5l/netlist/cp.spice at commit 093ab2c
* (feature/issue-165, issue #165 / DR-010 -- cp_dumpbuf rebuilt as a
*  complementary pair of unity-gain 5T OTAs so VDUMP tracks VOUT at DC;
*  cp_dumpbuf gains an IBP pin. This commit will be superseded by a different
*  squash-merge sha on main; the tree content it names is unchanged by that
*  rewrite).
* NOT a replacement for ./cp.spice or ./cp_cascbias.spice (where present),
* which stay frozen so every earlier record reproduces unchanged.
* Independent of whatever design/sg13cmos5l/netlist/cp.spice says today.
*
* sg13g2-pll :: cp (SG13CMOS5L) -- generated by design/sg13cmos5l/netlist.sh from cp.sch
* xschem XSCHEM V3.4.7; do not edit by hand.
** sch_path: design/sg13cmos5l/cp.sch
.subckt cp UP DN IBP ICP IBN ICN VOUT VDD VSS
*.ipin UP
*.ipin DN
*.iopin IBP
*.iopin ICP
*.iopin IBN
*.iopin ICN
*.opin VOUT
*.iopin VDD
*.iopin VSS
XIUP UP UPB VDD VSS inv_hv
XIDN DN DNB VDD VSS inv_hv
XLEGP IBP ICP UP UPB VOUT VDUMP VDD cp_leg_p
XLEGN IBN ICN DN DNB VOUT VDUMP VSS cp_leg_n
XBUF VOUT IBN IBP VDUMP VDD VSS cp_dumpbuf
XMBP nxp IBP VDD VDD sg13_hv_pmos w=24u l=1u ng=1 m=1
XMBPC IBP ICP nxp VDD sg13_hv_pmos w=24u l=1u ng=1 m=1
XMCP ICP ICP VDD VDD sg13_hv_pmos w=6u l=3u ng=1 m=1
XMBN nxn IBN VSS VSS sg13_hv_nmos w=8u l=1u ng=1 m=1
XMBNC IBN ICN nxn VSS sg13_hv_nmos w=8u l=1u ng=1 m=1
XMCN ICN ICN VSS VSS sg13_hv_nmos w=2u l=3u ng=1 m=1
.ends

* expanding   symbol:  inv_hv.sym # of pins=4
** sym_path: design/sg13cmos5l/inv_hv.sym
** sch_path: design/sg13cmos5l/inv_hv.sch
.subckt inv_hv A Y VDD VSS
*.ipin A
*.opin Y
*.iopin VDD
*.iopin VSS
XMP Y A VDD VDD sg13_hv_pmos w=5u l=0.5u ng=1 m=1
XMN Y A VSS VSS sg13_hv_nmos w=2u l=0.5u ng=1 m=1
.ends


* expanding   symbol:  cp_leg_p.sym # of pins=7
** sym_path: design/sg13cmos5l/cp_leg_p.sym
** sch_path: design/sg13cmos5l/cp_leg_p.sch
.subckt cp_leg_p IBP ICP UP UPB VOUT VDUMP VDD
*.ipin IBP
*.ipin ICP
*.ipin UP
*.ipin UPB
*.opin VOUT
*.opin VDUMP
*.iopin VDD
XM1 tail IBP VDD VDD sg13_hv_pmos w=24u l=1u ng=1 m=1
XM2 sw ICP tail VDD sg13_hv_pmos w=24u l=1u ng=1 m=1
XSWO VOUT UPB sw VDD sg13_hv_pmos w=6u l=0.3u ng=1 m=1
XSWD VDUMP UP sw VDD sg13_hv_pmos w=6u l=0.3u ng=1 m=1
.ends


